    "body": "_Requested by **Sia** · follow-up to #504 (merged)_\n\n## Merge order\n\n- Based on `main` after #504; touches only `sp-batch-report-view` (doc, tangled `.el`, tests). No conflict expected.\n- Branch is `claude/project-thread-4a39fy`: the cloud proxy cannot rename a branch, so it needs the number prefix from Sia.\n\n## What changed\n\n- BibTeX keys are cut after 20 characters (was 45) and the `BibTeX file` name after 10 (`sp-batch-report-truncated-columns`).\n- The Title column gets at least 60% of the window width (`sp-batch-report-flexible-share`); the other columns narrow, widest first, down to 8 characters, to make room.\n- Below about 90 columns the other columns cannot narrow enough, so Title gets what is left.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `tests/sp-batch-report-view-test.el`: 21 tests, 20 pass, 1 skipped without Org. New: Title keeps 60% at several widths and the file column stays within 10.\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [ ] `M-x sp-author-notes-bibtex`: Key column is about 20 characters, `.bib` name about 10, each ending in `…`\n- [ ] Title takes at least 60% of the frame width, and all tables still line up\n- [ ] Narrow the frame: Title keeps its share until the other columns reach their minimum\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9bi8g2P4sdH8GttsS)_",
